----- the same
  prints the same on both engines, 3 lines

----- one result
  prints 1 line of 3 differently; the first is line 2:
    on Zeff 0.9.0: educ           0.0412
    on Zeff 0.9.1: educ           0.0413

----- one warning more
  prints the same on both engines, 3 lines
  Zeff 0.9.1 raises W1002, which Zeff 0.9.0 does not

----- one warning fewer, and the same twice is once
  prints the same on both engines, 3 lines
  Zeff 0.9.0 raises W1002, which Zeff 0.9.1 does not

----- more lines
  prints 3 lines on Zeff 0.9.0 and 4 lines on Zeff 0.9.1; the first that differs is line 4:
    on Zeff 0.9.0: (nothing)
    on Zeff 0.9.1: n              5,200

----- stops on the other
  runs on Zeff 0.9.0 and stops on Zeff 0.9.1:
    error[Z0401]: `reg` cannot be called on a Float
  prints 3 lines on Zeff 0.9.0 and 0 lines on Zeff 0.9.1; the first that differs is line 1:
    on Zeff 0.9.0: coefficient  estimate
    on Zeff 0.9.1: (nothing)

----- stops on both, alike
  stops on both engines, with the same error:
    on Zeff 0.9.0: error[Z0101]: no variable `incme`
  prints the same on both engines, 0 lines

----- stops on the pinned engine only
  stops on Zeff 0.9.0 and runs on Zeff 0.9.1; on Zeff 0.9.0:
    error[Z0103]: no function `glm`
  prints 0 lines on Zeff 0.9.0 and 3 lines on Zeff 0.9.1; the first that differs is line 1:
    on Zeff 0.9.0: (nothing)
    on Zeff 0.9.1: coefficient  estimate
